"src":"https://cdn.blinkcms.com/org/or13109/co229/media/2_Interstitial-usa-new-sample.png","alt":"Dealer Location Map","id":"ixr22d"},"__prev-display":"flex"}],"custom-name":"MapAdGroup"}]}]}]}],"custom-code-plugin__code":"<section class="geoslide-section">
  <div class="geoslide-container">
    <div class="map-container">
      <img src="path-to-map-image.jpg" alt="Dealer Location Map" class="dealer-map">
      <div class="dealer-marker">Dealer Location</div>
    </div>
    <div class="process-info">
      <h2>About the process...</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>A primary catchment area based on dealer location is defined for example a 5-mile radius around the retail location</li>
        <li>Consumers living within this proximity will be eligible to receive targeted ad delivery to any device</li>
        <li>Targeting is based on on-line activity such as keyword usage and sites visited "look-a-likes"</li>
        <li>Ongoing retargeting ads are served to consumers after having visited the Mirage site</li>
        <li>The Dealer location is geofenced allowing us to discover the Mobile ID of consumers that were served ads whether they acted or clicked on an ad or not providing a count of the number of consumers entering a retail location</li>
        <li>Dealer name, location and phone numbers will appear on the ad units when the consumer is within closest proximity to the specific retailer</li>
        <li>Consumers are taken to the promo-page where we track and report on individual activity</li>
        <li>KPI's – Click to Call, Get Directions, Free Sample, Maestro Page exit to Dealer Site, Walk-In store visits</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dealer-info">
    <img src="path-to-mirage-logo.png" alt="Mirage Logo" class="mirage-logo">
    <div class="dealer-location">
      <img src="path-to-mapbox-logo.png" alt="Mapbox Logo" class="mapbox-logo">
      <h3>Barwood Pilon - Laval</h3>
      <p>Planchers Barwood-Pilon</p>
      <p>4280 Autoroute des Laurentides Local 2C,</p>
      <p>Laval, QC H7L 5C3</p>
      <p>Obtenir un itinéraire</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
